    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 26 · Lead Re-engagement\nOne friendly check-in to leads quiet for 30+ days (never older than 180 days), only if they're still reachable,\nnot booked, not handed to a person and have no follow-ups pending. At most once every 90 days per lead.\nTurn off per client with `settings.reengagement.enabled = false`.",
        "width": 620,
        "height": 260
